  "description": "Transactional outbox primitive for .NET. Enqueue messages inside an EF Core SaveChanges transaction; a background dispatcher hands them to a pluggable IOutboxSink at-least-once. Ships ChannelOutboxSink (in-process); broker sinks are opt-in sub-packages.",
